# RiskCore — Project Rules for AI Agents (Cline / OpenCode)

---

## ⛔ ABSOLUTE RULE — Read before doing anything

**NEVER run `git commit` or `git push` without explicit user confirmation.**

- "Implement X" → NOT permission to commit
- "Fix the bug" → NOT permission to commit
- "Finish the task" → NOT permission to commit

The only valid permission is the user explicitly saying: *"yes, commit"*, *"commit group 1"*, or similar.

**Allowed without asking:** `git status`, `git diff`, `git log`, `git branch`, `git stash`
**BLOCKED until explicit permission:** `git commit`, `git push`, `git merge`, `git rebase`, `git tag`

